---
import PrimaryButton from "./ui/PrimaryButton.astro";
import SecondaryButton from "./ui/SecondaryButton.astro";
---

<section
  class="py-32 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center min-h-[50vh]"
>
  <!-- Ambient background glow without a heavy card -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none -z-10"
  >
    <div
      class="w-full max-w-2xl h-64 bg-hero-glow/5 blur-[100px] rounded-full"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center z-10">
    <h2
      class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight leading-[1.15]"
    >
      Deja de adivinar.<br />
      <span class="inline-block relative mt-2">
        <!-- Text with shimmer effect matching the Hero section -->
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-hero-glow via-emerald-300 to-emerald-600 bg-size-[200%_auto] animate-shimmer">
          Empieza a valorar.
        </span>
        <span class="absolute inset-0 bg-hero-glow blur-2xl opacity-10 -z-10 mix-blend-screen"></span>
      </span>
    </h2>

    <p
      class="text-lg md:text-xl text-text-secondary mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed"
    >
      Únete a los profesionales que ya usan Inteligencia Artificial para tomar
      el control de sus carreras, justificar sus tarifas y maximizar sus
      ingresos.
    </p>

    <!-- Using the exact same button components from the Hero section -->
    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto"
    >
      <PrimaryButton
        href="https://valora-webapp.vercel.app"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        text="Entrar a la Web App"
      />

      <SecondaryButton
        href="/downloads/valora.apk"
        download={true}
        text="Descargar APK"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
